[{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「你……不是在说谎吧？」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a73","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"廉太郎","text":"「当然了。我哪敢对巫女大人动手动脚的啊」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a77","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"廉太郎","text":"「要是做了那种事，全班，不，全镇子都会看不起我啊。搞不好家人都会跟我断绝关系的」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a102","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「好吧。那这边就交给你了」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a102","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"廉太郎","text":"「好嘞」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a85","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"廉太郎","text":"「那么，巫女大人，我们开始钓鱼吧」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a85","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a956","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「请多关照」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a85","position":"右","x":240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255},{"asset":"a953","position":"左","x":-240,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我们也开始吧，蕾娜」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a963","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「好的，拜托你了！」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a960","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「那首先挂上鱼饵」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a960","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「对了，鱼饵该用什么？」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a975","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「蚯蚓就可以」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a975","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「蚯蚓？」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a1065","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我看看……你等一下」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a1065","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"","text":"我取出廉太郎给我的蚯蚓，挂在鱼钩上。","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「像这样」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「对。鱼饵像这样挂上去就行……好，ＯＫ。然后就是把鱼钩投进河里了」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「很简单呀」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a979","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「呼……」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"","text":"虽说是在山里，但我们是一直走到这里来的，感觉有些热。","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"","text":"把连帽衫脱了吧。","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「嘿……哟」","art":{"background":"a1066","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"","text":"在我没注意的时候，蕾娜大幅度地将鱼竿举过了头顶。","art":{"background":"a1066","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"","text":"——哇！","art":{"background":"a1066","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「给我等等！没必要在这么狭窄的地方举过头顶，你这样反而很危险——」","art":{"background":"a1066","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「喝啊！」","art":{"background":"a1067","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"","text":"但是完全兴奋起来的蕾娜并没有听见我的叫喊。","art":{"background":"a1067","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"","text":"在她猛地往下挥动鱼竿的瞬间，我的Ｔ恤被勾住了！","art":{"background":"a1067","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「疼疼疼疼疼疼疼疼疼疼疼疼！」","art":{"background":"a1068","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「哇哦，这么快就上钩了！是条大鱼！我拉我拉！看我使劲拉！」","art":{"background":"a1069","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「不是！只是勾到了衣服而已，快停下！衣服要破了！」","art":{"background":"a1070","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"","text":"但即便如此，蕾娜还是没有减轻力气。","art":{"background":"a1070","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"","text":"没办法！只能先保衣服了！","art":{"background":"a1070","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"","text":"我举起双手——Ｔ恤一下子就被脱掉了。","art":{"background":"a1071","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"","text":"于是，蕾娜顺利地钓到了东西。","art":{"background":"a1071","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「哇！？将臣，我钓到奇怪的鱼了！这是什么！？」","art":{"background":"a1072","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「那不是鱼，是我的Ｔ恤」","art":{"background":"a1072","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「Ｔ恤？」","art":{"background":"a1072","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a1072","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"","text":"蕾娜可能冷静了一点，她正在无言地看着我。","art":{"background":"a1072","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"","text":"我脱掉了连帽衫，Ｔ恤也被扒下……上半身是光溜溜的。","art":{"background":"a1072","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"","text":"虽说我是男人，但她这么死死盯着我看，我还是会害羞的啊。","art":{"background":"a1072","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"","text":"我用手臂遮着胸口，半开玩笑似地用做作的声音尖叫了一声。","art":{"background":"a1072","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「呀，不要看人家啦」","art":{"background":"a1073","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「……」","art":{"background":"a1073","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「……咦？没反应？」","art":{"background":"a1074","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"","text":"唔……她没反应，那我该如何收场呢。","art":{"background":"a1074","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"","text":"玩笑话都说出口了，这让我更加羞耻了。","art":{"background":"a1074","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「呃……那个，蕾娜？」","art":{"background":"a1074","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「……裸……裸」","art":{"background":"a1075","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「哇呀！？裸，裸，男人的裸裸裸裸裸裸裸裸裸裸裸裸裸裸」","art":{"background":"a1076","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「～～～～～～！？」","art":{"background":"a1077","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「喂，蕾、蕾娜！？」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"","text":"她都双眼打转倒在地上了！","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「……嗯……」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「等、等一下，蕾娜！！坚持住！」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「……裸体……男人的裸体……」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"","text":"这……看样子暂时是清醒不过来了。","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「麻烦了……」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「总之……先把手帕打湿贴在她额头上吧」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「非常抱歉，给你添麻烦了」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a1078","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「用不着在意我」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a1078","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「先不说这个，你真的没事吗？」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a1078","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「是的，我没事。我只是看到男人的裸体……有些被吓到了」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a1079","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「你害怕男人？」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a1079","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「不，不是不是！不是这样的！」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a1080","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「只是单纯不习惯看人裸体……真的吓到了」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a1081","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「是吗，抱歉吓到你了」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a1081","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「没、没事！你没有错。应该道歉的是我……抱歉」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a1082","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「我甚至还失去了意识……让你担心了」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a1083","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「你没事就好」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a1083","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"","text":"虽然在我印象中，外国人应该比较开放……但那只是我的刻板印象。","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a1083","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"","text":"话说，她这反应未免太纯朴了吧。","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a1083","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"","text":"看来在这方面，不管是在都市还是乡村，是在日本还是在外国，都是取决于性格的啊。","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a1083","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「冷静下来了？」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a1083","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「是的。我已经没事了。意识很清醒，身体也没有任何不舒服」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a1084","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-33.33333333333333,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「我想再试一次，可以重新教我钓鱼吗，将臣」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a960","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「没问题。但这次麻烦你镇静一点好吗？」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a960","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「这条河并不是很宽，不用举过头顶，轻轻投进去就行了」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a960","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「好的，我明白了」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a978","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"","text":"这次，蕾娜冷静地将鱼线悬在水面上。","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「然后，把腰弯下去。别被鱼发现」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「鱼会发现我们吗？」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a965","position":"85%","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「若是河面上有影子，或者发出响动的话，鱼就会发现我们的」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a965","position":"85%","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「喔，鱼好聪明呀。原来钓鱼这么讲究的啊」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a979","position":"85%","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「淡水鱼就是这样，只要钓上一条，别的鱼就会提高警惕，所以在同一个地方钓不了很多」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a979","position":"85%","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「有点小看它们了。淡水鱼真是不容小觑」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a963","position":"85%","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我说，现在什么反应都没有吗？」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a963","position":"85%","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「这个我也说不准……感觉好像有点沉沉的……？」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a975","position":"85%","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「就算有鱼上钩了，你也不会被用力往下拉的。毕竟都是小鱼」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a975","position":"85%","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「是这样吗？那么……」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a1020","position":"85%","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-39.39393939393939,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「哇哦！真的上钩了！还活蹦乱跳的！」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a960","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「现在把鱼拉过来，然后取下鱼钩，注意不要让鱼钩脱落」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a960","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「敢摸鱼吗？」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a960","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「嗯，没问题」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a978","position":"出","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"","text":"蕾娜将鱼线拉到身边，三下五除二地取了下鱼。","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"","text":"然后立刻将鱼扔进了水桶里。","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「喔……这鱼真可爱啊」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a979","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「我可以把它带回去吗？我想让厨师长教我怎么杀鱼」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a960","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「没问题」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a960","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"},{"speaker":"蕾娜","text":"「谢谢你，嘻嘻」","art":{"background":"a1044","sprites":[{"asset":"a978","position":"中","x":0,"y":0,"zx":100,"zy":100,"z":-50.0,"opacity":255}]},"chapter":"3-2"}]